{#
  Pagination modes (2.23, View\Pagination::$mode `infinite` | `responsive`): the peer contract added by the
  `pagination` / `pagination_compact` partials when a mode other than `pager` is set (never for `pager`: unchanged
  markup). The pager links stay in the markup (the no-JS fallback); the `list-pagination` Stimulus peer
  (stimulus-peers/list_pagination_controller.ts) hides them while it loads the next pages into the list.

  Input:
    - part: `attrs` (the root attributes) or `extras` (the load-more region and the live region)
    - mode: infinite | responsive; mode_narrow / mode_wide: pager | infinite; breakpoint: media query; auto_loads
    - next_href: URL of the next page (same filters / sort / per_page; null on the last page)
    - bundle, trans_domain
  Root attributes: data-controller="list-pagination", data-nowo-ui-pagination-mode, -narrow, -wide, -query (media
  query of the narrow side), -auto (automatic loads before the button only), -next, -loaded-text (%count%),
  -error-text. Extras: [data-nowo-ui-pagination-more-region] (hidden until the peer shows it) with the sentinel
  [data-nowo-ui-pagination-sentinel] and the "Load more" button [data-nowo-ui-pagination-more] (slot btn_secondary),
  and the polite live region [data-nowo-ui-pagination-status].
#}
{%- set _domain = trans_domain|default('NowoUiKitBundle') -%}
{%- set _m = mode == 'responsive' ? 'responsive' : 'infinite' -%}
{%- set _narrow = _m == 'infinite' ? 'infinite' : (mode_narrow|default('infinite') == 'pager' ? 'pager' : 'infinite') -%}
{%- set _wide = _m == 'infinite' ? 'infinite' : (mode_wide|default('pager') == 'infinite' ? 'infinite' : 'pager') -%}
{%- if part == 'attrs' -%}
    {{- nowo_ui_html_attrs({
        'data-controller': 'list-pagination',
        'data-nowo-ui-pagination-mode': _m,
        'data-nowo-ui-pagination-narrow': _narrow,
        'data-nowo-ui-pagination-wide': _wide,
        'data-nowo-ui-pagination-query': breakpoint|default('(max-width: 900px)'),
        'data-nowo-ui-pagination-auto': max(0, auto_loads|default(3)),
        'data-nowo-ui-pagination-next': next_href|default(null),
        'data-nowo-ui-pagination-loaded-text': 'pagination.loaded'|trans({}, _domain),
        'data-nowo-ui-pagination-error-text': 'pagination.load_error'|trans({}, _domain),
    }) -}}
{%- else -%}
    <div class="nowo-ui-pagination__more" data-nowo-ui-pagination-more-region hidden>
        <span class="nowo-ui-pagination__sentinel" data-nowo-ui-pagination-sentinel aria-hidden="true"></span>
        <button type="button" class="{{ nowo_ui_class('btn_secondary', bundle|default(null)) }}" data-nowo-ui-pagination-more{{ nowo_ui_attrs('btn_secondary', bundle|default(null)) }}>{{ 'pagination.load_more'|trans({}, _domain) }}</button>
    </div>
    <p class="visually-hidden" role="status" aria-live="polite" data-nowo-ui-pagination-status></p>
{%- endif -%}
